  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong>XOMD Affiliate Program Summary</strong></p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>About Our Brand &amp; Products:</strong><br>XOMD Skin is the first of its kind Moodceutical™, both a premium skincare brand rooted in science and self-care as well as a proven way to boost confidence and connection.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">Our products are formulated with clinically backed ingredients to deliver real results, focusing on skin health, radiance, and confidence.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>What Makes Us Different:</strong><br>We blend modern dermatological science with clean, cruelty-free formulations that not only make you look better, we help you feel better too.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every sale made through their unique referral links. Bonuses and tiered rewards are available for top performers.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>How to Promote Us:</strong><br>Share your experience with XOMD Skin on blogs, YouTube, Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, or email newsletters using your custom affiliate link. We provide brand assets, exclusive promos, and ongoing support to help you succeed.</p><p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>Other Information:</strong><br>Enjoy early access to new product launches, affiliate-only discounts, and a passionate, engaged community. Join us in helping others glow with confidence — one product at a time.</p></div></div>",
